    <briefdescription>
<para>POSIX file control options (&lt;<ref refid="fcntl_8h" kindref="compound">fcntl.h</ref>&gt;) </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Defines the file-control commands, file-descriptor flags, file-access mode flags, and related types used with <ref refid="group__posix__option__group__device__io_1gac843f2e35e60c3bbf1da47d84306f29b" kindref="member">open()</ref>, <ref refid="group__posix__option__group__file__system_1gafddc24a65767ae35f275be8ccf53e036" kindref="member">creat()</ref>, and <ref refid="group__posix__option__group__fd__mgmt_1gacfc4bf677fc9f8be66d9624175cb3775" kindref="member">fcntl()</ref>.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ulink url="https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9699919799/basedefs/fcntl.h.html">POSIX.1-2017 &lt;fcntl.h&gt;</ulink> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
